      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/2033-rest-previous-ops\n\nResolve the conflicts with the corner relief of #2400:\n- rest2d: emit_rest (shared by both rest modes) takes the CornerRelief\n  and plans the reliefs as main's rest_pocket_with_relief did.\n- rest_prior: add rest_pocket_previous_with_relief; rest_pocket_previous\n  keeps its signature and passes no relief.\n- generate: the previous-operations arm passes corner_relief too.\n- rest_previous_ops test fixture: add the corner_relief field.\n\nPin: crates/motion/tests/rest_relief.rs.\n\nRefs #2033\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
